WEBVTT

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:04.270
<i>After a long slumber,</i>

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.850
<i>the legendary Onigami Susanoo 
arises again to a world in turmoil.</i>

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:14.370
<i>Various schemes have been secretly put in motion</i>

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:17.990
<i>by people hoping to use its mysterious 
power for their own purposes.</i>

00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:32.520
You've gotten better, Tsubaki.

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:35.590
Thank you, ma'am.

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:37.910
Um, Houkouin-sama...

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:39.430
The message from Shigeyoshi-sama...

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:42.350
Come here, Tsubaki.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:47.770
O-Onee-sama...

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:50.480
Now tell me your report...

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:55.730
Shigeyoshi-sama orders you 
to kill Tokugawa Keiichiro

00:00:55.730 --> 00:01:01.200
before he masters the power of the Susanoo!

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:06.330
How boring.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:08.830
But if we don't stop Susanoo...

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.300
No, not there!

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:16.190
I'll need your help for that.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:19.200
My help?

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:21.950
Will you help me?

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:26.960
Whatever you wish, Onee-sama...

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:35.770
You're such a good girl...

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:38.800
Onee-sama! Onee-sama!

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:50.700
<b>Dai Shogun</b>

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:50.700
Great Revolution

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:15.040
Good morning, Kei-chan!

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:16.290
Ch-Chiharu!

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:17.590
It's a great morning!

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.220
Time for a wake-up kiss!

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.140
Good morning, Keiichiro-sama.

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:40.080
Keiichiro-sama.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:43.070
Let's have breakfast.

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:46.870
<b>Men</b>

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:51.580
B-Boss...

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.710
You're supposed to clean the women's bath!

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:58.500
Nah, the ice queen is doing 
that one, so it's fine.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:02.450
Let's finish what we started this morning.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:04.760
S-Stop—

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.120
Who are you calling an ice queen?

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:13.890
I warned you not to cling to 
Keiichiro-sama like that.

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:15.660
H-Hey, Kiriko...

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:18.360
What's wrong with clinging to the person I love?

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:21.760
Keiichiro-sama will someday rule this country.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:25.860
A woman like you is not even 
worthy to be in his presence.

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:30.460
He may be the Shogun's heir or whatever, 
but that means nothing to me!

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:31.410
Nothing?

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:35.120
I'm in love with Kei-chan. 
Not the Tokugawa family!

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:38.290
Way to go, Boss! You're such a ladies' man!

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:39.840
So which one are you going to choose?

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:42.550
Shut up!

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:49.280
Sheesh.

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:56.770
Damn fools, saying whatever 
the hell they want...

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.020
Kei-chan!

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:00.900
You're taking a bath alone? Don't be so cold!

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.310
I'll wash your back!

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:08.230
Oops, I slipped!

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:11.450
Hey...

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:14.290
<i>God, not while she's naked!</i>

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:22.150
What are you doing?

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:23.670
What the hell are <i>you</i> doing?

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:26.720
Jeez, you'll really show 
up anywhere, won't you?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:30.930
She's quick at running away.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:35.180
Keiichiro-sama, you need to 
be more responsible, too.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:40.190
She's only acting this way because you let her.

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.440
Are you saying it's my fault?

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:45.750
No, just that I think if you 
tell her firmly to stop,

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.910
this won't happen anymore.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.600
What?

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:52.070
You're going to be the next Shogun someday.

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:55.750
Please remember that you are 
of the Tokugawa family!

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:57.460
Enough of this crap!

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:00.240
All you ever talk about is the damn Tokugawa.

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:03.340
I like Chiharu a hell of 
a lot more than I like you!

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.880
At least she's not only interested 
in me 'cause I'm the Shogun's heir!

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:19.770
Wh-What's going on, Chiharu-san?

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.610
I need your help.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.770
No matter what you need, there's no way!

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:27.320
No, you're the only one I can ask!

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:30.530
I-I'm the only one?

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:35.040
If you do it, you can do whatever 
you want with me for a whole night.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.750
S-Seriously?

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:40.980
You got it!

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:44.040
I'll do it! Hyakusuke, the man, 
will do whatever you want!

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:46.050
So give me payment up front...

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:50.010
Go keep an eye on the ice queen, then.

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:52.470
On Kiriko-san?

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:55.660
I'm going to wait until she 
takes her eyes off of Kei-chan,

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:57.560
so I can be alone with him.

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:00.520
So I need you to watch her!

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:08.780
<b>Episode 3: 
The Sex Witch Houkouin Strikes!</b>

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.740
I like Chiharu a hell of 
a lot more than I like you!

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:18.860
Kiriko?

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:20.160
Y-Yes?

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:22.080
The moon's beautiful tonight.

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:24.330
Want to chat for a bit?

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:27.210
Y-Yes.

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:29.170
All right.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:31.680
I must get ready, so I'll see you in a half hour.

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:34.770
Okay. I'll see you at the foot of Kido Bridge.

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:52.360
Jeez, she sure is carefree.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.450
J-Just a little won't hurt, right?

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:11.670
Chiharu-san! Chiharu-san!

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:16.010
Oh, Kei-chan, it's so big!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:18.850
What are you saying? 
Kiriko-san's on the move!

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:27.800
This is my chance!

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:27.800
Wait!

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:36.280
Kei-chan!

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:39.160
Ch-Chiharu!

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:40.620
What are you doing here?

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:44.040
I'm here to do you, silly!

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:46.050
S-Stop it!

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:49.200
C'mon, stop struggling!

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:51.040
Kei-chan!

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:54.800
Once the boss is done, it's my turn!

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:10.770
Keiichiro-sama...

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:18.240
What?

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:20.480
I knew you were an impostor from the start.

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:22.950
Keiichiro-sama cares nothing for me.

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:25.080
Then...

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:32.920
I'll take your body and use it 
to get closer to Keiichiro.

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:40.550
Stop it!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.940
Do you hate me?

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:48.980
N-No, it's not that...

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:55.320
Kei-chan, I've really fallen in love with you.

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:01.200
How do you like it?

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:05.040
I'm going to take control of your body.

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:07.500
Is that all you've got?

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:08.330
What?

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:16.900
Don't underestimate an Iga Ninja's 
training to protect her virginity.

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:19.970
I've been subjected to such moves 
so often, I'm sick of them.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:24.600
This is the female body 
sealing technique: Hanashibu!

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:27.790
N-No...

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:38.460
I may not look it,

00:10:38.460 --> 00:10:41.660
but I told you I've been 
alive for 250 years, right?

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:48.330
I think I was 100 years old when 
I first went to bed with a man.

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:50.380
He was the first guy I loved.

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:54.240
But I couldn't tell him I was a monster.

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:57.300
But all of a sudden, my mind went blank,

00:10:57.860 --> 00:11:02.140
and the next thing I knew, I was 
under him and I'd changed my form.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:06.010
Of course, he ran away.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:10.810
Ever since then, I've been 
scared of transforming,

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:12.730
so I've stayed a virgin.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:18.290
But you saw me as a monster 
and told me you didn't care.

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:20.570
So I want you to have my body.

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:25.370
Will you make me a woman?

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:32.710
Chiharu...

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:46.970
No... only Onee-sama can touch me there!

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:51.730
Is your "Onee-sama" Houkouin?

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:55.220
Tell me who's behind her.

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:00.080
If you won't tell me, I won't stop.

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:06.150
I-It's a member of one of the three 
branch families of the Tokugawa,

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:08.790
Hitotsubashi Shigeyoshi!

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:23.970
What's going on?

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:40.980
Susanoo, come out!

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:56.040
Now, come out!

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:03.490
Wh-What is that Puppet?

00:13:03.490 --> 00:13:06.810
Get back! I've seen that thing before!

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:10.220
Oh, it's that kid.

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:14.270
Call out Susanoo already.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:20.270
I don't need that huge thing! 
I can kick your ass myself!

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:23.240
You're going to fight me with that hammer?

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:28.930
It's so sad to be weak.

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:30.030
What?

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:37.290
I guess the fact that you can't admit 
your weakness is proof you're a virgin!

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:41.010
Kei-chan is a...

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:46.510
He's so manly and cool and strong 
and confident and the perfect man,

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:48.030
and he's a v-v-v-virgin?!

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:50.000
Shut up! It's not like that!

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:53.850
This stupid curse makes me go numb if I 
touch a woman and pass out if I touch boobs!

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:57.480
Anyway, I'm not weak!

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:00.150
So naïve.

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:04.940
You think you can beat me when 
you've never known a woman?

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.500
Kei-chan!

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.360
Keiichiro-sama!

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:28.970
Ow...

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:30.240
Kiriko!

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:33.760
Keiichiro-sama, that Puppet is 
an assassin, sent to slay you!

00:14:34.090 --> 00:14:36.660
Use this, quickly!

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:41.350
I have to rely on this again?

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:07.810
Finally! Finally!

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:09.970
I've been waiting for this!

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:12.670
Wh-What?

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:44.700
What's with that Puppet?

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.420
It's not a Puppet.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:49.010
It's an Onigami!

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.130
Let's go!

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:57.220
Not again!

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.810
How do I make this thing move?

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:09.480
No matter how big it is, if you 
can't make it stand up, it's useless.

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:15.990
Let me give you a hot lick!

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:23.370
Keiichiro-sama!

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:27.130
Well, that was disappointing.

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:30.300
She's fast! I couldn't even see her!

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:34.800
This is boring. Simply boring.

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:38.180
I guess you're not as good as you looked.

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:42.260
Keiichiro-sama, you can't beat 
her with Susanoo right now!

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:49.520
You couldn't even slow her down, Tsubaki?

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:53.780
Only two people together can bring 
out the full power of Susanoo!

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:54.780
What?

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:57.990
So please, let me in there!

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:01.700
But... this thing won't do what I tell it to!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.840
Over here!

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:27.370
It didn't choose me?

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:29.930
Ch-Chiharu?

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:31.860
Kei-chan! You're safe!

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:34.190
Not here, damn it!

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:37.360
Get out of there, little girl!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.160
No!

00:17:40.310 --> 00:17:44.000
Kei-chan, nobody will bother us here!

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:45.120
S-Stop it!

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:48.460
Kei-chan!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:53.710
You're going to ignore me? You've got guts.

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:58.390
You're in the way, Chiharu. Sit down!

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.300
Kei-chan!

00:18:21.760 --> 00:18:23.580
Wh-What is that?

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.420
<b>Demon</b>

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:31.670
<b>Beast</b>

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:41.010
Th-That's...

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:44.430
<b>Susanoo Exploding Passion Beast God</b>

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.730
This is amazing!

00:18:57.730 --> 00:19:00.420
The Onigami changed its form!

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:03.580
What is this? It feels so right...

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:07.870
So this is the true power of Susanoo?

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:13.630
Those big arms are such a turn-on...

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.880
It's truly the perfect Onigami...

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:20.720
to run through with my blade!

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:22.640
She's coming!

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:26.760
I'm going to be your first, boy!

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:28.950
I don't think so!

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:29.930
Let's go, Chiharu!

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:31.480
Yeah, Kei-chan!

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:46.530
This is...

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:51.540
How'd you like that?

00:19:52.430 --> 00:19:55.840
This feeling... it's been too long!

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:58.800
I can't believe a little 
boy is making me so wet.

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.970
It'd be a waste to defeat you here.

00:20:04.270 --> 00:20:08.960
Young fruit tastes best just 
before it falls to the ground.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:12.980
I want you to ripen even more.

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:16.230
Hey, wait!

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:28.900
Kei-chan!

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:28.900
Hey!

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:30.020
Stay away from me!

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:33.600
Hey, why are you trying to run?

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:34.180
I told you, stay away!

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:37.540
It can't hurt, right? Come on, Kei-chan!

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:37.000
Seriously, cut it out! Stop!

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.450
Stay away!

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:43.800
Looks like that girl may be the person 
my stupid boy is fated to be with.

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:49.100
My mission is to awaken the power of Susanoo.

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:55.360
If she is to be its wielder, 
that's fine with me.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:59.940
Sheesh... She just can't be honest.

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:13.290
It's pathetic, but I had to rely on you again.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:17.640
But I could feel an incredible power inside me.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:21.040
What exactly are you?

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:27.760
Kei-chan! This means we really 
are fated to be together!

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:29.850
Hey, let me go!

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.430
I won't!

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:33.870
We got through that battle together!

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:36.440
S-Stop!

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:42.000
<i>Beast God Susanoo continues 
to sleep in intrepid silence.</i>

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:45.160
<i>Now that its hidden seals have been broken,</i>

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:52.480
<i>what will become of the pure man, 
and the women, who are its key?</i>

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:29.170
Next time, we've got lady 
pirates and lady swordsmen!

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:30.550
More chicks with big boobs?

00:23:30.550 --> 00:23:32.990
They're after Susanoo, not the boss?

00:23:32.990 --> 00:23:36.000
Come on, Chiharu, you've gotta do 
whatever it takes for Kei-chan!

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:37.320
Next time, another predicament that'll

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:41.180
<b>Next Time: 
Susanoo Hijacked! 
The Vicious Asai Hyogo!</b>

00:23:37.320 --> 00:23:38.240
decide the future of Japan!

00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:39.370
I'll do it!
